WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.300
Add an interface label with t()

2
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.900
An empty string shows an error with its line

3
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.200
Write the string: the preview is back

4
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:27.500
Publish the component and its strings

5
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:34.300
Drupal lists the new string for translation

6
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.800
Translate it into Polish

7
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.100
The Polish page shows the translated labels

8
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.800
Annual billing: a Polish plural form
